      ( Q - R ) ang ( P - R ) ) ) ) ) = ( ( ( 1 / 2 ) x. ( ( abs ` ( T - U ) ) x. ( abs ` ( S - U )
      ) ) ) x. ( abs ` ( sin ` ( ( T - U ) ang ( S - U ) ) ) ) ) )
