# Lines AB and CD whose direction quotient is not real meet: at
# A + s (B - A), with s = Im r / Im q, where q = (B - A)/(D - C) and
# r = (C - A)/(D - C), the place along line CD is s q - r, whose imaginary
# part is 0.
